WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.182
The thread adds one to sixteen million

00:00:03.182 --> 00:00:05.098
seven hundred seventy-seven thousand two

00:00:05.098 --> 00:00:07.397
hundred sixteen. Float thirty two rounds

00:00:07.397 --> 00:00:10.079
the sum back to the original value.

00:00:14.579 --> 00:00:17.470
The thread then adds the negative of the

00:00:17.470 --> 00:00:20.000
original value. What happens to the one?

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:30.981
The starter grouping returns zero because

00:00:30.981 --> 00:00:33.875
the one was rounded away. Canceling the

00:00:33.875 --> 00:00:36.356
large positive and negative values first

00:00:36.356 --> 00:00:37.183
gives one.
